      "4": "Dark swept side-wave hair/brows, pearl drop earrings and pearl necklace, navy coat with gold circular lapel pin over purple crossed blouse/floral clasp retained against blue backing. Rounded yellow face with one small downturned mouth opening; short broad necklace/collar fit, lower yellow taper follows actual blouse V without a separate long stalk. No clearly modeled human ear/nose, opaque costume/backing."
